Typical Instruments: Hand-bored silver piccolo, wood piccolo, Hammond B3 organ with cracked Leslie speakers, Mellotron M400, 1970s Roland System 100 modular synthesizer, Maestro Echoplex tape delay unit, EMU SP-1200 drum computer, distorted 808 sub-bass.

